\"></rect><rect x=\"70\" y=\"150\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--color-accent-700)\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent-500)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"116\" y=\"150\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--color-accent-700)\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent-500)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"162\" y=\"150\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"208\" y=\"150\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"254\" y=\"150\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"300\" y=\"150\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"346\" y=\"150\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--color-accent-700)\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent-500)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"24\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--color-accent-700)\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent-500)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"70\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--color-accent-700)\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent-500)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"116\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"162\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"208\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"254\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"300\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-neutral-600)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"346\" y=\"182\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--color-accent-700)\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent-500)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"40\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr); gap: 40px; max-width: 720px;\"><section data-dc-tpl=\"41\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"42\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">O gargalo depois da infraestrutura</h2><p data-dc-tpl=\"43\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\">Com Confluent Cloud ou Confluent Platform, a infraestrutura do Kafka está resolvida. O gargalo passa a ser outro: quantas pessoas conseguem usar o Kafka sem depender de um especialista. Inspecionar mensagens, entender um schema ou descobrir quem consome um tópico costuma exigir CLI, acesso amplo e conhecimento que poucos têm.</p></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"44\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"45\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">O que o Lenses adiciona</h2><p data-dc-tpl=\"46\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\">O Lenses é uma camada de experiência sobre o Kafka. Permite consultar tópicos com SQL, independentemente do formato (Avro, Protobuf, JSON), ver a topologia de produtores, conectores e consumidores, e acompanhar fluxos e lag. Tudo isso com permissões por time, para que cada squad veja e opere apenas o que é dele.</p></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"47\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"48\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Como os dois se complementam</h2><p data-dc-tpl=\"49\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\">O Confluent continua sendo a plataforma: clusters, Schema Registry, conectores gerenciados, Flink e governança de streams. O Lenses fica na frente das pessoas, como portal do dia a dia. Na prática, os squads usam o Lenses para explorar e depurar, e o time de plataforma usa o Confluent e a automação (Terraform) para provisionar e governar.</p></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"50\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"51\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Como implementar</h2><p data-dc-tpl=\"52\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\">Defina primeiro o modelo de acesso: grupos por squad ou domínio, com namespaces de tópicos. Conecte o Lenses ao cluster com uma conta de serviço de permissão mínima. Comece por um ou dois times e meça quanto tempo cai em tarefas como inspecionar uma mensagem ou investigar um consumidor atrasado.</p></section><section data-dc-tpl=\"53\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\"><h2 data-dc-tpl=\"54\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Para aprofundar</h2><p data-dc-tpl=\"55\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--color-neutral-100);\">Escrevemos um artigo dedicado ao Lenses como ferramenta de developer experience, com exemplos de uso. O link está nas referências abaixo.</p></section><div data-dc-tpl=\"56\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding-top: 24px; background: linear-gradient(to right,var(--color-neutral-700),transparent) top/100% 1px no-repeat;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"57\" style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">Referências</span><a data-dc-tpl=\"58\" href=\"https://docs.lenses.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size: 14px; word-break: break-all;\">docs.lenses.io ↗</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"59\" href=\"https://docs.confluent.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size: 14px; word-break: break-all;\">docs.confluent.io ↗</a><a data-dc-tpl=\"60\" href=\"https://mateus-oliveira.medium.com/lenses-developer-experience-para-apache-kafka-c0446416ae93\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"font-size: 14px; word-break: break-all;\">mateus-oliveira.medium.com/lenses-developer-experience-para-apache-kafka-c044641 ↗</a><span data-dc-tpl=\"61\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--color-neutral-400);\">Artigo técnico da Intelium.</span></div><div data-dc-tpl=\"62\" class=\"card\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 24px;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"63\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500;\">Quer aplicar isso no seu contexto?</span><a data-dc-tpl=\"64\" href=\"../../contato/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Falar com o CoE →</a></div></div><section data-dc-tpl=\"65\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; padding-top: 40px; background: linear-gradient(to right,transparent,var(--color-neutral-700) 48px calc(100% - 48px),transparent) top/100% 1px no-repeat;\"><span data-dc-tpl=\"66\" style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent);\">Mais artigos</span><div data-dc-tpl=\"67\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, max(clamp(33.33% - 11px, -99900% + 959040px, 50% - 8px), -99900% + 519480px)), 1fr)); gap: 16px;\"><a data-dc-tpl=\"69\" href=\"../../blog/lenses-governanca/\" class=\"scp1\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); color: var(--color-text); overflow: hidden; transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\"><div data-dc-tpl=\"70\" style=\"p